OL,3,GNEWSALarge water mains burst shuts road
OL,4,
OL,5,FA road has been closed and diversions
OL,6,Fput in place after a large water main
OL,7,Fburst.
OL,9,FIt happened on the A689 at
OL,10,FHowden-le-Wear near the Gulf petrol
OL,11,Fstation in the early hours, according
OL,12,Fto Northumbrian Water.
OL,14,FThe water firm said its team had
OL,15,Fquickly isolated the issue so that
OL,16,Fresidents' water supplies were not
OL,17,Faffected. Repairs on the pipe are still
OL,18,Ftaking place and the A689 between
OL,19,FBridgefield Court and Park Terrace
OL,20,Fremains shut.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
